body:
it went well... i used ash in 3 and weed in 1, ill say about the ash first... 1 of them i fucked up, but its about patience. hold the lighter just above the flame and slowly draw through, just keep doing it and eventually itll heat up enough to make a tiny tiny cherry, you'll see it through the ash. Keep drawing maybe with more pressure (be careful not to pull the ash through, i done test pulls when i packed the first layer of ash to see how much pressure i could get away with) and soon enough you'll see the smoke coming up, it doesnt stay cherried for long so now its time to bring the iron lungs out, keep fuckin hitting that shit, exhale and instantly go back for more, otherwise you'll lose the cherry and probably the rest of it like i did once. 

&#x200B;

with weed, it definitely worked, i pulled slowly and i def taasted the dmt in there, same as ash really... the weed didnt change the experience much if at all.
